{"id":"n25282-1-9","stage":3,"title":"공포 · 恐怖","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25282-1-9-1","ko":"공포 영화를 좋아하세요?","zh":"您喜欢恐怖电影吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공포","meaning":"恐怖","explanation":"공포：恐怖。","readings":[{"term":"공포","audio":"/audio/6c82c24828d233714fc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25282","senseId":"1","lemma":"공포","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공포","audio":"/audio/6c82c24828d233714fc1.mp3"}},{"text":"영화를","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화를","audio":"/audio/dede45f73452f5a077ee.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하세요?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하세요","audio":"/audio/dff68e1bb91a7d3e7728.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6c82c24828d23371","term":"공포","zh":"恐怖","audio":"/audio/6c82c24828d233714fc1.mp3","entryId":"25282","definition":"恐惧害怕。","pronunciation":["공ː포"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7271e6ceb40d1d37dc58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25282-1-9-2","ko":"아니요. 저는 무서운 건 딱 질색이에요.","zh":"不喜欢。我简直最讨厌恐怖的东西了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseI